              <h3>HEALTH &amp; SERVICES CAREER EXPO NOV. 18</h3>
                                <div class="mb-2">
                <p>More than 20 businesses and organizations will be on hand to meet with job seekers at the inaugural Sandburg Health and Services Career Expo from 11 a.m.-1 p.m. Nov. 18.</p>
