              <div class="has-divider">
              <div class="py-5 px-2 text-center text-wrapper">
              <h3>KADEN PICKARD NAMED 2026 STUDENT LAUREATE BY THE LINCOLN ACADEMY OF ILLINOIS</h3>
                                <div class="mb-2">
                <p>A few years ago, Kaden Pickard had a grade point average that started with a 1 and was convinced college wasn&#8217;t a fit for him. Now he's receiving arguably the most prestigious award given to an Illinois community college student.</p>
              </div>
                              <a class="btn-link" href="https://www.sandburg.edu/Sandburg_News/2026/10/Sandburgs%20Kaden%20Pickard%20named%202026%20Student%20Laureate%20by%20The%20Lincoln%20Academy%20of%20Illinois.html?feature">Read more about Kaden's story.</a>
                            </div>
              </div>
          </div>
