              <img alt="Accounting-type papers on a desk" src="images/accounting3.jpg"/>
              <div class="has-divider">
              <div class="py-5 px-2 text-center text-wrapper">
              <h3>PROPERTY TAX PROPOSAL</h3>
                                <div class="mb-2">
                <p><span>A public hearing to approve a proposed property tax levy increase for Community College District No. 518, for 2026, will be held 5:30 p.m. Nov. 19th, 2026, in the boardroom (E200) at Sandburg's Galesburg campus.</span></p>
              </div>
                              <a class="btn-link" href="https://www.sandburg.edu/Sandburg_News/2026/10/PROPOSED%20TAX%20INCREASE.html">View property tax hearing information.</a>
                            </div>
              </div>
