              <div class="py-5 px-2 text-center text-wrapper">
              <h3>SANDBURG HOSTS VETERANS DAY TRIBUTE TO LOMAC PAYTON</h3>
                                <div class="mb-2">
                <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e376ab2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content" data-e-type="widget" data-element_type="widget" data-id="e376ab2" data-widget_type="theme-post-content.default">
<div class="elementor-widget-container">
<p><span>Sandburg honored Korean War veteran and former Galesburg City Council member Lomac Payton during a Veterans Day tribute event hosted by the student organization Men of Distinction.</span><br/><br/></p>
</div>
</div>
              </div>
                              <a class="btn-link" href="https://www.sandburg.edu/Sandburg_News/2026/11/Sandburg%20hosts%20Veterans%20Day%20tribute%20to%20Lomac%20Payton.html">See photos from the event.</a>
