              <div class="has-divider">
              <div class="py-5 px-2 text-center text-wrapper">
              <h3>THE SANDBURG PODCAST: KADEN PICKARD, LINCOLN ACADEMY OF ILLINOIS STUDENT LAUREATE</h3>
                                <div class="mb-2">
                <div dir="auto">
<p>Kaden Pickard joined The Sandburg Podcast&#160;to discuss becoming just the second student in Sandburg history to be named a Student Laureate by the Lincoln Academy of Illinois, arguably the most prestigious award given to an Illinois community college student.</p>
</div>
              </div>
                              <a class="btn-link" href="https://www.sandburg.edu/Sandburg_News/2026/11/The%20Sandburg%20Podcast%20Kaden%20Pickard%20Lincoln%20Academy%20of%20Illinois%20Student%20Laureate.html?feature">Listen to the podcast.</a>
                            </div>
              </div>
