              <div class="has-divider">
              <div class="py-5 px-2 text-center text-wrapper">
              <h3>FOUNDATION SCHOLARSHIP RECEPTION CONNECTS DONORS, RECIPIENTS</h3>
                                <div class="mb-2">
                <p><span>The Sandburg Foundation's annual scholarship reception connects donors with the students who benefit from their contributions. Each year, more than $225,000 in Sandburg Foundation scholarships help students toward their dream of becoming college graduates.&#160;</span></p>
              </div>
                              <a class="btn-link" href="https://www.sandburg.edu/Sandburg_News/2026/10/Sandburg%20Foundation%20Scholarship%20Reception%20connects%20donors,%20recipients.html">Watch a video featuring scholarship recipients.</a>
                            </div>
              </div>
